        <h1 class="page-title">Research</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Six projects. The first three are ordered by how central they are to one
          question: what can be proved about the stochastic objects machine learning
          already runs on. The answer is usually less than one would hope, and more than
          gets checked. The other three, in computer science, carry the same habits,
          a closed form where one exists and a registered prediction where one does not,
          into the systems that run large language models.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
